From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 18:51:45 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Preserve bounded application traffic across fetch authority
 fences

Actual runtime authority loss and invalidity epochs cancel fetch state, but application engines have already committed queued actions. Preserve their original bounded input and output bytes and deadlines while Observe continues to pause all processing without authoritative chain state.

Retire rewritten block-only notfound input without replaying its already-emitted application half, and reset the block-notfound discriminator before fresh traffic resumes. The pre-fix regression fails by closing the application connection; the repaired focused suite passes 13 groups, including exact-once application resume, mixed notfound cleanup, durable invalidity output preservation, fetch leases and ephemeral TCP. Independent review and focused execution pass. Ordinary tip changes already preserve fetches; mixed tx/proof dispatch is already partitioned by Node::HandleApplication.
---
